  data: {
    LLM: 'Deal and betting as in 7-card stud. At showdown, the second-highest five-card hand wins the pot. If all but one fold, that player wins. If there is a tie for first, none of those hands wins and the next highest hand takes the pot; if there is a tie for second, the equal hands split the pot.',
    Player: 'Deal and betting as in 7-card stud. At showdown, the second-highest five-card hand wins the pot. If all but one fold, that player wins. If there is a tie for first, none of those hands wins and the next highest hand takes the pot; if there is a tie for second, the equal hands split the pot.',
    objective: 'Win the pot by having the second-best hand at showdown; the second-highest hand takes the entire pot.',
    gameplay: 'Deal and betting as in 7-card stud. At showdown, the second-highest five-card hand wins the pot. If all but one fold, that player wins. If there is a tie for first, none of those hands wins and the next highest hand takes the pot; if there is a tie for second, the equal hands split the pot.',
